    "detailed_description": "<strong>Tile Ruler</strong> is a <i>puzzle platformer</i> with new kind of twist! You will have to select blocks/items and use them to beat different levels. But you can't take all these items with you, there is a limit. Taking less and less items will guarantee better score, and make levels more puzzling. So are you ready to use a selective mind and platformer skills to complete the story?<br><br>There are 30 levels with different solutions, as a goal to reach the exit sign. The levels will get harder, and player will be presented new content in his adventure. Using simple platformer as a platform, these levels aren't too easy for any kind of adventurer.<br><br>Properties:<br>- Level can be viewed and certain amount of tiles/blocks/items can be selected before level starts.<br>- Tiles can be placed near player, and tiles can be blocks, usable and passive items.<br>- The game is progressive, and new content is presented when game progresses.<br>- The goal is to reach exit sign with possible requirements.<br>- If you get stuck, use walkthrough in the game menu under 'Help'.<br>- Mouse and keyboard.<br>- Singleplayer.<br><br>Known Issues:<br>- Supports only 16:9 Screen Resolution and it will be always set.",
